@startuml 04_process_training
title SpeedLimit: training process (BPMN-style swimlanes)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6

|DataLoader + DataCleaner|
start
:Read CSV files
(BOM, ";", decimal comma,
optional header);
:Drop licence plates;
:Repair months, remove duplicates,
null out-of-range values;
:Combine redundant sensors by median,
fill short gaps;
:Build one row per hour (744);

|NearAccidentLabeler|
:Shift accident hours 1..24 to 0..23;
:Count near-accidents per hour
(SkidAngle, CloseCarCm, CloseGuardrailCm);

|DataValidator|
:Run hard checks and warnings;
:Write data_validation.json;
if (All hard checks pass?) then (no)
  :Stop: raise DataValidationError; <<#FFDDDD>>
  stop
else (yes)
  :Allow training;
endif

|FeatureBuilder|
:Keep dark or black-ice hours (389);
:Build 9 features;

|EnsembleTrainer|
:Split by day
train 1-21, validation 22-26, test 27-31;
:Fit scaler on training days only;
fork
  :Network 1
  (seed, day bootstrap,
  early stopping);
fork again
  :Networks 2..9;
fork again
  :Network 10;
end fork
:Save ensemble, scaler, support
and skill to model.pt;

|Evaluator|
:Compare with constant baseline and GLM
(Poisson deviance, MAE, MSE);
:Repeat with day-grouped cross-validation;
:Measure ensemble coverage;
:Write training_report.json;
stop
@enduml
